{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃翠如與蕭正楠早前帶同一歲半的兒子「蕭哈哈」展開一家三口的首次外遊，飛赴馬來西亞探望兒子的契爺契媽。黃翠如於社交平台分享短片，坦言出發前緊張得幾乎失眠三晚，更向其他媽媽請教帶娃絕招，準備了各式玩具、果汁與故事，打算在飛機上全力應戰。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1f1fa3db-e646-4c6d-a4a6-00f4e4f40b70.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026c5iCciNTst1788921274.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1f1fa3db-e646-4c6d-a4a6-00f4e4f40b70.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">短片中的哈哈出發前顯得十分興奮，不僅眼仔睩睩四處張望，更學會了說「Happy」和「哈哈」。他更完美展現了蕭家的「秒睡」本領，直接在父親蕭正楠的懷中睡著，讓黃翠如笑言這是蕭家「點樣都瞓得」的優良傳統。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c2574972-9b48-4d04-a98c-eb697a9b5f4a.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026sKk9jBg2lv1788921273.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c2574972-9b48-4d04-a98c-eb697a9b5f4a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1b183706-c94f-4ee5-a71b-1cefe0fc8fce.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026wzulMsrFDu1788921273.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1b183706-c94f-4ee5-a71b-1cefe0fc8fce.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">抵達目的地後，叉足電的哈哈立即活力滿滿，與契哥互動溫馨。其精靈可愛的模樣大受網民歡迎，紛紛留言大讚他遺傳了父母的優良基因，既像迷你版媽媽又像蕭正楠。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T03:00:12.065722+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}